<title>DENMARK: Danish Realkredit Danmark profits down in 1996.</title>
<headline>Danish Realkredit Danmark profits down in 1996.</headline>
<dateline>COPENHAGEN 1997-02-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>12-months to December 31 1996</p>
<p>					  (million crowns unless stated)</p>
<p> Group net result			1,386.9 vs 2,154.0</p>
<p> Losses and bad debt provisions	102.6 vs   390.1</p>
<p>Pre-tax and extra.items result     2.089.6 vs 2.455.1  Group pre-tax result		 1.879.8  vs 2.444.8</p>
<p> Securities and forex results	 420.4  vs   781.0</p>
<p>Balance end-1996  334.8 billion vs 334.4 billion end-1995</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of Denmark's second biggest mortgage credit firm is Realkredit Danmark A/S. It said in a statement that expected a pre-tax profit in 1997 of 1.2 billion crowns.</p>
<p>--Chris Follett, Copenhagen newsroom, 45-33-969652</p>
</text>
